Now I couldn't, I don't know,

00:34:39.040 --> 00:34:41.970
my legs have went out I guess
from the impact of the crash.

00:34:41.970 --> 00:34:42.953
So I'm in this backyard,

00:34:42.953 --> 00:34:44.957
I hear the dog barking on the other side,

00:34:44.957 --> 00:34:46.580
then I don't hear him barking anymore,

00:34:46.580 --> 00:34:48.389
so I'm dragging myself through the grass.

00:34:48.389 --> 00:34:50.550
While my homie that was sitting shotgun,

00:34:50.550 --> 00:34:51.840
he had ran the other way.

00:34:51.840 --> 00:34:52.728
I guess when we ran,

00:34:52.728 --> 00:34:53.840
I ran this way,

00:34:53.840 --> 00:34:54.800
he ran that way,

00:34:54.800 --> 00:34:58.050
but we circled around and
met up in the same backyard,

00:34:58.050 --> 00:34:59.840
the one I was dragging myself through.

00:34:59.840 --> 00:35:01.240
So my homie came out of the bushes,

00:35:01.240 --> 00:35:02.073
he's like, what's wrong?

00:35:02.073 --> 00:35:04.020
I told him, I can't walk, help me out,

00:35:04.020 --> 00:35:05.275
stash me somewhere, you know.

00:35:05.275 --> 00:35:06.983
So he grabbed me, he pulled me,

00:35:06.983 --> 00:35:08.850
he put me under the pool table

00:35:08.850 --> 00:35:10.755
in somebody's backyard in their patio.

00:35:10.755 --> 00:35:12.087
I'm under the pool table,

00:35:12.087 --> 00:35:14.610
and I remember, I'm
trying to catch my breath,

00:35:14.610 --> 00:35:17.403
and all of a sudden,
through that blue tarp,

00:35:18.420 --> 00:35:21.020
the dog just busted through, boom

00:35:21.020 --> 00:35:22.698
and grabbed me by my arm.

00:35:22.698 --> 00:35:24.527
So he started biting my arm

00:35:24.527 --> 00:35:25.970
and I remember he was biting my arm,

00:35:25.970 --> 00:35:27.827
I'm looking and he's just pulling my skin,

00:35:27.827 --> 00:35:30.430
you know, all these holes
on my arm right here,

00:35:30.430 --> 00:35:31.770
all these are from the K9, you know,

00:35:31.770 --> 00:35:33.339
so he's biting me, he's biting me.

00:35:33.339 --> 00:35:35.410
So as when he try to bite me in my neck,

00:35:35.410 --> 00:35:37.520
I put my hand up, he bit
me one time in this hand.

00:35:37.520 --> 00:35:39.070
While he bit in this hand,

00:35:39.070 --> 00:35:40.510
I grabbed him by the snout,

00:35:40.510 --> 00:35:42.057
by his nose and top teeth,

00:35:42.057 --> 00:35:43.740
then I grabbed his bottom teeth

00:35:43.740 --> 00:35:45.470
and I was just gonna try to rip his mouth

00:35:45.470 --> 00:35:47.490
because he already had bit
me numerous times, you know,

00:35:47.490 --> 00:35:49.030
he bit me all on this arm,

00:35:49.030 --> 00:35:50.390
he bit me like three times in this arm,

00:35:50.390 --> 00:35:51.770
my arm was leaking everywhere,

00:35:51.770 --> 00:35:53.070
I had those blood everywhere.

00:35:53.070 --> 00:35:54.190
But as soon as I grabbed him

00:35:54.190 --> 00:35:55.780
and I was gonna rip his mouth open,

00:35:55.780 --> 00:35:57.330
I remembered, leave my dog alone,

00:35:57.330 --> 00:35:58.718
and hit me in the back of the head,

00:35:58.718 --> 00:36:01.740
knocked me on the cement
floor that I was on

00:36:01.740 --> 00:36:04.560
by the side of the pool table.

00:36:04.560 --> 00:36:08.900
When I came to, I hear the cop asking me

00:36:08.900 --> 00:36:10.330
where my homie was.

00:36:10.330 --> 00:36:11.600
Now my homie, mind you

00:36:11.600 --> 00:36:13.783
was right in this garage door right here,

00:36:13.783 --> 00:36:15.350
because I was in the patio,

00:36:15.350 --> 00:36:16.390
he went into the garage door

00:36:16.390 --> 00:36:18.200
and left me under the pool table.

00:36:18.200 --> 00:36:19.791
Well, as soon as he was
asking me for my homie,

00:36:19.791 --> 00:36:23.490
he had the K9 snapping at my face,

00:36:23.490 --> 00:36:24.562
now I was in handcuffs,

00:36:24.562 --> 00:36:27.790
some lady comes out of her
house that owns that house

00:36:27.790 --> 00:36:29.540
and she tell the cop, leave him alone,

00:36:29.540 --> 00:36:31.740
he's just a child, I
was only 14 years old.

00:36:31.740 --> 00:36:33.570
So, I could imagine how small I looked,

00:36:33.570 --> 00:36:35.780
through all these grown men with a dog,

00:36:35.780 --> 00:36:37.160
biting the shit out of me,

00:36:37.160 --> 00:36:38.380
so I didn't give up my homie,

00:36:38.380 --> 00:36:39.770
what does he do,

00:36:39.770 --> 00:36:41.210
lets the dog go on me again.

00:36:41.210 --> 00:36:43.360
So now the dog bites my leg,

00:36:43.360 --> 00:36:45.240
tears me two bigger holes in my leg

00:36:45.240 --> 00:36:46.860
because I couldn't do anything,

00:36:46.860 --> 00:36:48.070
I was handcuffed,

00:36:48.070 --> 00:36:50.030
so I'm screaming at the top of my lungs,

00:36:50.030 --> 00:36:52.130
man, I'm asking, begging
him to get the dog off me.

00:36:52.130 --> 00:36:53.840
Five minute fell, five minutes,

00:36:53.840 --> 00:36:55.340
three, four, five minutes later,

00:36:55.340 --> 00:36:56.745
another dog comes through the gate,

00:36:56.745 --> 00:36:59.200
he's on my homie's scent.

00:36:59.200 --> 00:37:01.442
So my homie hear me screaming and yelling,

00:37:01.442 --> 00:37:03.163
the dog runs up to the door,

00:37:03.163 --> 00:37:05.610
I can hear my homie on the
other side of the door saying,

00:37:05.610 --> 00:37:07.080
I'm coming out.

00:37:07.080 --> 00:37:08.524
Too late, when he opened that door,

00:37:08.524 --> 00:37:10.123
that dog jumped up,

00:37:10.123 --> 00:37:11.890
hit him in his chest,

00:37:11.890 --> 00:37:14.773
my homie fell and I heard my homie scream.

00:37:14.773 --> 00:37:17.200
I've never heard a man
screamed like that in my life,

00:37:17.200 --> 00:37:18.530
that dog bit the shit out of him,

00:37:18.530 --> 00:37:19.882
tore up both his legs.

00:37:19.882 --> 00:37:23.330
Well, you know, the one
thing my homie told me

00:37:23.330 --> 00:37:24.163
when we got busted,

00:37:24.163 --> 00:37:25.760
because they took us to
the general hospital,

00:37:25.760 --> 00:37:28.340
they put us on the 13th
floor, the jail ward.

00:37:28.340 --> 00:37:30.243
First, he took us to the Pico hospital,

00:37:30.243 --> 00:37:33.840
fixed it up, then the
sent us to the jail ward

00:37:33.840 --> 00:37:36.320
in USC, the general hospital alley,

00:37:36.320 --> 00:37:37.590
downtown general,

00:37:37.590 --> 00:37:39.600
and they put us in the 13th
floor in the jail ward.

00:37:39.600 --> 00:37:42.170
You had be 16 years old and
up to go in the jail ward.

00:37:42.170 --> 00:37:44.037
Of course in the jail ward,

00:37:44.037 --> 00:37:44.870
I remember my homie looked over

00:37:44.870 --> 00:37:47.140
and leaned over and looked at me and said,

00:37:47.140 --> 00:37:49.710
man, you didn't even give me up

00:37:49.710 --> 00:37:50.970
when that dog was biting you.

00:37:50.970 --> 00:37:52.760
He said, I would've gave you up.

00:37:52.760 --> 00:37:54.096
If the dog would've bit me,

00:37:54.096 --> 00:37:55.153
or while it was biting me,

00:37:55.153 --> 00:37:56.390
I would've told them
exactly where you're at.

00:37:56.390 --> 00:37:59.240
He goes, Johnny, you never
told them where I was at.

00:37:59.240 --> 00:38:00.100
See I wasn't even tripping

00:38:00.100 --> 00:38:01.230
that my homie was in the garage

00:38:01.230 --> 00:38:02.063
and he can hear everything,

00:38:02.063 --> 00:38:03.410
because they kept asking me,

00:38:03.410 --> 00:38:04.330
where's your homie, where's your homie,

00:38:04.330 --> 00:38:05.163
I didn't give him up.

00:38:05.163 --> 00:38:06.117
They let the dog go and the
dog started biting me again,

00:38:06.117 --> 00:38:08.030
they were still asking
me, where's your homie,

00:38:08.030 --> 00:38:09.380
and I didn't know.

00:38:09.380 --> 00:38:11.953
I knew where he was, but
remember I was schooled

00:38:11.953 --> 00:38:15.630
a long time ago not to ever
tell on anybody in general.

00:38:15.630 --> 00:38:16.651
Don't sign no papers,

00:38:16.651 --> 00:38:18.101
don't talk to nobody.

00:38:18.101 --> 00:38:20.577
And remember my homie already told me that

00:38:20.577 --> 00:38:22.640
and he goes, you didn't even break, man

00:38:22.640 --> 00:38:24.110
when they had the K9 biting you,

00:38:24.110 --> 00:38:26.409
and I was like, nah-uh,
I wasn't gonna break.

00:38:26.409 --> 00:38:28.980
So what happened was, I
couldn't sue or nothing,

00:38:28.980 --> 00:38:30.250
because they were Pico sheriffs,

00:38:30.250 --> 00:38:32.610
they let the dog go, I
got a high pursuit chase

00:38:32.610 --> 00:38:33.970
after the shooting.

00:38:33.970 --> 00:38:35.670
They tried to put the
shooting and me together

00:38:35.670 --> 00:38:37.101
and high speed chase, I wrecked.

00:38:37.101 --> 00:38:39.440
My homegirls didn't press no charges,

00:38:39.440 --> 00:38:41.180
one broke her pelvis in the back,

00:38:41.180 --> 00:38:42.040
she limps today,

00:38:42.040 --> 00:38:43.812
another one has a big
ol' scar on her forehead,

00:38:43.812 --> 00:38:45.820
but my older brother ended up marrying

00:38:45.820 --> 00:38:48.070
their older sister, so
they're part of the family.

00:38:48.070 --> 00:38:51.453
That was one time when, you
know, the cops chased me,

00:38:51.453 --> 00:38:54.150
sink K9s on me and I
knew they were playing

00:38:54.150 --> 00:38:55.430
for keeps then, you know what I mean.

00:38:55.430 --> 00:38:57.167
I knew that it was on
and popping, you know.

00:38:57.167 --> 00:39:00.750
After that, if I seen a cop
pull up with a K9 in his car,

00:39:00.750 --> 00:39:01.890
oh, I wasn't trying to run.

00:39:01.890 --> 00:39:04.048
No way a cat would outrun a dog, you know,

00:39:04.048 --> 00:39:05.490
especially the K9.

00:39:05.490 --> 00:39:07.480
If their on your scent,
they'll cut through anything,

00:39:07.480 --> 00:39:09.370
they will climb walls,
they will jump fences.

00:39:09.370 --> 00:39:10.960
- [Mark] Did you do any
prison time for that?

00:39:10.960 --> 00:39:12.442
