00:39:14.108 --> 00:39:15.530
and then my uncle went
to camp and did a year,

00:39:15.530 --> 00:39:16.560
my other one did a year,

00:39:16.560 --> 00:39:18.810
and I did nine months
in camp for that alone.

00:39:18.810 --> 00:39:20.160
You know, they try to
get me for the shooting,

00:39:20.160 --> 00:39:22.180
they couldn't place it,
the time was messed up,

00:39:22.180 --> 00:39:24.410
so they just got me for the GTA,

00:39:24.410 --> 00:39:27.600
but I already had seven GTAs prior.

00:39:27.600 --> 00:39:29.807
I had a total of 11 GTAs
when I went to camp.

00:39:29.807 --> 00:39:30.968
- [Mark] (indistinct)

00:39:30.968 --> 00:39:31.940
- Oh, yeah.

00:39:31.940 --> 00:39:34.197
We had the master car to go to Saragossa,

00:39:34.197 --> 00:39:36.300
and we used to steal all of them.

00:39:36.300 --> 00:39:38.700
Some of them would be run
down, you know, and cheap.

00:39:38.700 --> 00:39:40.704
Some of them would be nice
ass cars with systems.

00:39:40.704 --> 00:39:42.710
You know, we found so
many things inside them,

00:39:42.710 --> 00:39:43.845
we found guns inside them,

00:39:43.845 --> 00:39:45.660
we found dope inside them,

00:39:45.660 --> 00:39:46.493
money inside them, you know,

00:39:46.493 --> 00:39:48.926
all kinds of power tools, you know,

00:39:48.926 --> 00:39:51.644
everything you could
think of inside a car,

00:39:51.644 --> 00:39:52.477
you know what I mean.

00:39:52.477 --> 00:39:53.310
And we used to take these cars

00:39:53.310 --> 00:39:55.077
and we just take everything out them,

00:39:55.077 --> 00:39:56.917
use them to go do some shootings

00:39:56.917 --> 00:39:59.018
and then leave the car there.

00:39:59.018 --> 00:40:01.060
I burst whole many clutches, you know,

00:40:01.060 --> 00:40:02.390
it was pitiful, you know.

