00:40:24.510 --> 00:40:26.360
all the way through the backyard.

00:40:26.360 --> 00:40:27.920
And my house sits down here

00:40:27.920 --> 00:40:29.010
and then there's a hill that comes down,

00:40:29.010 --> 00:40:30.330
so the guy shot from an angle.

00:40:30.330 --> 00:40:32.077
The same guy, I went and broke his windows

00:40:32.077 --> 00:40:35.860
and shot at him, the day
before, the previous day.

00:40:35.860 --> 00:40:37.780
But before that day, he went and broke

00:40:37.780 --> 00:40:39.280
all my homegirl's windows.

00:40:39.280 --> 00:40:40.160
So what is was is,

00:40:40.160 --> 00:40:41.300
he broke my homegirl's windows,

00:40:41.300 --> 00:40:42.570
she came to me and told me,

00:40:42.570 --> 00:40:43.990
I went and broke his
windows, shot at his house,

00:40:43.990 --> 00:40:45.270
and then the following day,

00:40:45.270 --> 00:40:46.768
he came to shot at my house.

00:40:46.768 --> 00:40:48.149
Well, that's the day my grandfather

00:40:48.149 --> 00:40:50.939
